OL,3,GNEWSASponges 'lift off' tapestry's 50
OL,4,Ayears of grime
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 years of grime and
OL,7,F"engrained dirt" has been painstakingly
OL,8,Flifted off from a tapestry using "many,
OL,9,Fmany make-up sponges".
OL,11,FThe Town Tapestry was embroidered by
OL,12,Fmembers of Chesham Arts Society to
OL,13,Fshowcase scenes of the Buckinghamshire
OL,14,Ftown.
OL,16,FThe town council said it was sent to
OL,17,FZenzie Tinker Conservation, in
OL,18,FBrighton, which carried out more than
OL,19,F30 hours of cleaning and restoration
OL,20,Fwork "to safeguard it for decades to
OL,21,Fcome".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
