OL,3,GNEWSASponges 'lift off' tapestry's 50
OL,4,Ayears of grime
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has now been re-hung in the council
OL,7,Fchambers inside a bespoke frame with
OL,8,Facrylic glazing.
